1
00:00:00,075 --> 00:00:02,659
Di batu yang sama dengan Sphinx...

2
00:00:02,659 --> 00:00:04,944
terkubur seekor buaya purba.

3
00:00:04,944 --> 00:00:06,592
Hampir 100 tahun...

4
00:00:06,592 --> 00:00:07,968
ia salah dikenali.

5
00:00:07,968 --> 00:00:09,925
Tengkoraknya digali dekat Kairo,

6
00:00:09,925 --> 00:00:11,835
lalu dicap kerabat senyulong...

7
00:00:11,835 --> 00:00:14,757
buaya moncong panjang dari
Sumatra dan Kalimantan.

8
00:00:14,757 --> 00:00:17,378
Sampai CT scan membongkar tengkoraknya:

9
00:00:17,378 --> 00:00:18,951
ia bukan golongan senyulong...

10
00:00:18,951 --> 00:00:21,049
tapi cabang awal keluarga gharial!

11
00:00:21,049 --> 00:00:22,809
Namanya Herugavialis,

12
00:00:22,809 --> 00:00:23,895
dari dewa Horus.

13
00:00:23,895 --> 00:00:25,918
Sebab ujung moncongnya hilang...

14
00:00:25,918 --> 00:00:27,275
persis hidung Sphinx!

15
00:00:27,275 --> 00:00:29,938
Kirim ke temanmu yang suka misteri Mesir!
